          "source": "// Lorenz attractor. parameters[0] = (sigma, rho, beta, world units per Lorenz unit);\n// parameters[1] = (center x, y, z, time scale). Lorenz z is world up.\n[[visible]] void lorenz(thread ParticleState &particle, float deltaTime, float time, constant float4 *parameters) {\n    float4 shape = parameters[0];\n    float4 frame = parameters[1];\n    float3 local = (particle.position - frame.xyz) / shape.w;\n    float3 p = float3(local.x, local.z, local.y + shape.y - 1.0);\n    float3 derivative = float3(\n        shape.x * (p.y - p.x),\n        p.x * (shape.y - p.z) - p.y,\n        p.x * p.y - shape.z * p.z\n    );\n    particle.velocity = float3(derivative.x, derivative.z, derivative.y) * shape.w * frame.w;\n}\n"
        },
